OL,3,GNEWSAOral history project to record
OL,4,Atown's memories
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn oral history project has been
OL,7,Flaunched to record memories of life and
OL,8,Fthe "unsung heroes" of a historic
OL,9,Fharbour town.
OL,11,FThe project in Falmouth, Cornwall, will
OL,12,Fbuild up an online archive and those
OL,13,Fbehind it said they were particularly
OL,14,Finterested in memories from the 1950s
OL,15,Fand 1960s.
OL,17,FPeople will be trained to do the
OL,18,Finterviews and organisers said
OL,19,Frecordings "preserve an accent, a turn
OL,20,Fof phrase, laughter, emotion and the
OL,21,Fway someone tells a story".
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
