OL,3,GNEWSAOral history project to record
OL,4,Atown's memories
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Victoria May, from RAW Falmouth,
OL,7,Fsaid: "We're asking local people to
OL,8,Fhelp preserve the Falmouth they
OL,9,Fremember - the shops, working lives,
OL,10,Fchildhood adventures, familiar
OL,11,Fcharacters and places that have changed
OL,12,For disappeared."
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
